# Source footage of real people stays out of the public repo; BRIEF.md says where it comes from.
projects/*/public/*.mp4
# A song made by a music model is not ours to hand out as a file: the film carries it, the repo does not
# (see projects/2026-11-github-101/public/song/NOTICE.md).
projects/*/public/song/*.mp3
